counterfactuals.output:
1. A three-dimensional object forming apparatus comprising:

a build platform configured to support formation of a three-dimensional object;

a material dispensing unit configured to dispense a modeling material for forming the three-dimensional object;

a decorative ink head configured to discharge a decorative ink forming a visible decorative layer;

a transparent ink head configured to discharge a transparent ink forming a transparent layer; and

a reflective ink head configured to discharge a reflective ink forming a reflective layer,

wherein the decorative ink head, the transparent ink head, and the reflective ink head are arranged and controlled such that, in a completed three-dimensional object, the decorative layer is disposed at a surface side of the three-dimensional object, and the transparent layer and the reflective layer are disposed beneath the decorative layer relative to the surface side.

2. The three-dimensional object forming apparatus of claim 1, wherein the transparent layer is disposed between the decorative layer and the reflective layer.

3. The three-dimensional object forming apparatus of claim 1, wherein the reflective layer is disposed inward of the transparent layer relative to the surface side of the completed three-dimensional object.

4. The three-dimensional object forming apparatus of claim 1, further comprising a controller configured to control discharge timing of the decorative ink head, the transparent ink head, and the reflective ink head so as to form, in order from an exterior surface toward an interior of the completed three-dimensional object, the decorative layer, the transparent layer, and the reflective layer.
